Neon containers port (M1), part 5 of 7: tab partition.

Gives new tabs, links and restored tabs the right storage partition, as
brave-core v1.100.58 (bd6d26d1) does: NavigateParams::storage_partition_config,
a container-aware tab_util::GetSiteInstanceForNewTab, inheritance for links
opened in a new tab, noopener windows and restored tabs, and permission
prompts inside container partitions. Replaces Brave chromium_src overrides.

